  "review_notes": [
    "Reconciliation patch: whomsoever now fuses כֹּל and the relative only. The preposition בּ (s005) is its own unrepresented unit under rule 40, as in the chapter's nine other נגע בְּ clauses, and the resumptive suffix וֹ (s006) its own under rule 22, as beside the which of v.12 and the whom of v.18.",
